<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION LEADING SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION LEADING SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
